{{!
  EntityExaminer composite placeholder for deferred checks.

  Hidden so it takes no space: the examiner script reads its data attributes
  and replaces it with an indicator only when a check finds an issue.

  Required data:
  - subject: string (escaped) - Subject page hash
  - dir: string (escaped) - Text direction
  - uselang: string (escaped) - Interface language code
}}
<div class="smw-entity-examiner-placeholder" data-subject="{{subject}}" data-dir="{{dir}}" data-uselang="{{uselang}}" hidden></div>
